er, payload branch = forest/canopy-critic-stale-selected-window/freshness-cycle-budget, revision = 73d14896ee481447a80453dbd97b57461e8383d6 (matches tip). Good.\n\nWait, let me verify the branch tip still matches the SHA. The ls-remote earlier showed 73d14896ee481447a80453dbd97b57461e8383d6 for that branch. And request payload revision = 73d14896ee481447a80453dbd97b57461e8383d6. Good.\n\nLet me also verify the request OID committer once more (I did: Builder <builder@forest.invalid>). Good.\n\nNow, let me write the Checks payload and Verdict payload.\n\nChecks payload:\n- revision: 73d14896ee481447a80453dbd97b57461e8383d6\n- results: \n  - {name: \"test\", ok: true, exit: 0}\n  - {name: \"vet\", ok: true, exit: 0}\n- time: RFC 3339 timestamp.\n\nI need an RFC 3339 timestamp. Let me generate current time.\n\nVerdict payload:\n- revision: 73d14896ee481447a80453dbd97b57461e8383d6\n- verdict: approve\n- summary: brief.\n- time: same.\n\nLet me get the current UTC time in RFC3339."}}
